{"text": "A fine, cold rain began to fall, and the wind grew stronger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The man from the West waited in the doorway for about twenty minutes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then a tall man in a long overcoat hurried across the street toward him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His coat collar was turned up high, all the way to his ears. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is that you, Bob, he asked doubtfully. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is that you, Jimmy Wells, cried the man in the doorway. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The tall man took both of his hands, It is Bob, sure as fate. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I was certain that I would find you here if you were still alive. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You have changed a lot, Jimmy, I never thought that you were so tall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Oh, I grew a little after I was twenty, answered the tall man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Are you doing well in New York, Jimmy, Fairly well, I have a job in one of the city departments. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The two men walked up the street arm in arm, and Bob began to talk proudly about his success.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", " ", "f", "i", "n", "e", ",", " ", "c", "o", "l", "d", " ", "r", "a", "i", "n", " ", "b", "e", "g", "a", "n", " ", "t", "o", " ", "f", "a", "l", "l", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", " ", "g", "r", "e", "w", " ", "s", "t", "r", "o", "n", "g", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "W", "e", "s", "t", " ", "w", "a", "i", "t", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", "w", "a", "y", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "t", "w", "e", "n", "t", "y", " ", "m", "i", "n", "u", "t", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T",